{
  "_comment": [
    "The popup's eighteen tools, its four groups, and its order, for the",
    "right-click menu. JSON and not a module on purpose: background/context-menus.js",
    "is in the service worker's static boot graph, which MV3 re-parses on every",
    "cold start, and tools/test-worker-imports.mjs holds that graph to a hard byte",
    "ceiling. A file fetched at menu-build time is not in the graph at all - menus",
    "are built on install and on startup, not at import - so this list costs the",
    "boot nothing.",
    "It is still a copy of popup/popup.js's TOOLS[] and GROUPS. tools/test-context-menus.mjs",
    "reads this file and that literal and fails the moment they stop matching on",
    "ids, labels, groups or order, so a rename in the popup cannot leave the menu",
    "reading the old word.",
    "label  must equal the popup's label, character for character.",
    "send   the handler the popup's own card ends up calling, or one of four words",
    "       for the tools whose card is not a single message: clip, coverage,",
    "       diagram, break.",
    "session  the result is kept with a session, so one has to be running. These",
    "       stay visible with no session and say so in their title."
  ],
  "groups": [
    {
      "id": "capture",
      "label": "Capture"
    },
    {
      "id": "check",
      "label": "Check"
    },
    {
      "id": "design",
      "label": "Design"
    },
    {
      "id": "break",
      "label": "Break"
    }
  ],
  "tools": [
